---
description: Test rules (engine.tests/**, ops/**/*.test.ts, tools/**/*.test.ts)
globs: engine.tests/**,ops/**/*.test.ts,tools/**/*.test.ts
alwaysApply: false
---
- Vitest. One test per rule from the contract card; name tests after the rule.
- Fixed seeds only. A test that depends on `Date.now()` or `Math.random` is a bug.
- Golden fixtures live in `engine.tests/golden/*.json` and are compared whole; regenerate only by `npm run golden:update`, never by hand, and say so in the commit.
- Tests run with nothing installed but Node. No renderer, no SDK, no network.
